{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/e3-statement-on-iranian-attacks","content_id":"c915b13b-661b-49c2-a5f9-4751b37b0461","description":"A statement by the E3 (UK, France & Germany) on Iranian attacks  in the Strait of Hormuz and countries in the region.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>We condemn Iran’s reckless attacks on commercial shipping in the Strait of Hormuz and countries in the region, including Qatar, Kuwait, Bahrain, Oman and Jordan.</p>\n\n<p>Respect for sovereignty over territorial seas and freedom of navigation are fundamental principles of international law.</p>\n\n<p>We reaffirm our continued support for the swift and full resumption of international shipping through the Strait of Hormuz and express full solidarity with our Gulf and regional partners.</p>\n\n<p>We also call for the resumption of the ceasefire and of negotiations.</p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-12T22:48:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26"],"images":[{"caption":null,"content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de5d3bf7f4f0b29b67c/s216_fcdo-main-building.jpg","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de48fa8f5490aff83b4/s300_fcdo-main-building.jpg","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de48fa8f549069a6616/s465_fcdo-main-building.jpg","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4d3bf7f4f0743dc7c/s630_fcdo-main-building.jpg","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4e90e0710acb2557a/s712_fcdo-main-building.jpg","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4e90e0710be0354d7/s960_fcdo-main-building.jpg"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"press_release","first_published_at":"2026-07-12T23:48:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/e3-s